      "refersTo": "path-primary",
      "description": "Selected file path with an aligned orange chevron.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-path ds-path-primary\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&gt;</span>about.md</button>",
      "css": ".ds-path{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;min-height:36px;padding:3px 12px 3px 0;font-size:16px;text-align:left;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;}.ds-path>span{width:14px;color:transparent}.ds-path:hover,.ds-path:focus-visible{background:#ff985215;color:var(--orange,#ff9852)}.ds-path:hover>span{color:var(--orange,#ff9852)}.ds-path:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--orange,#ff9852);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-path-primary,.ds-path-primary>span{color:var(--orange,#ff9852)}"
